Apple-Design Plan — 7 Phases
Phase 1 — Foundations ✅ (done)
- Design tokens in ui_kit.dart: AppSpacing (4pt), AppRadius, AppShadow (3-level depth), trackFor() size-specific tracking
- Theme in main.dart: type ramp with tracking on every text role, quiet InkRipple splash, card clipBehavior, single hairline token, scheme-driven colors
- ShellAppBar title tracking fixed for its 26px size
Phase 2 — Materials & scroll-edge
- Translucent BackdropFilter material for ShellAppBar, NavigationBar, BottomDock — content scrolls under chrome
- Scroll-driven hairline (appears when content passes under, not always-on) — replace ShellAppBar's permanent divider; add edge feedback to plain AppBars
- Consolidate 3 conflicting bottom-surface treatments (dock border+shadow / sheet footer border-only / ad-hoc padding with neither) into one
- Apply AppShadow scale to all ~28 ad-hoc BoxShadows; remove colored glows (kitchen card, pill button)
- Fix stacked-translucent-surface issue (identity chip over opaque gradient bar)
- Align radius mismatches (menu picker 22 vs theme 24, double drag-handles)
Phase 3 — Motion system
- New motion.dart: Apple spring presets (critically damped response 0.4 default; 0.8 bounce only after flicks), reduceMotion(context) guard, gated haptic helper
- Convert fixed-duration animations to springs (200/260/150/180ms sites)
- Fix the 900ms revenue count-up — settle from the previously presented value, don't restart at 0 on refresh
- Replace instant Opacity swaps with animated fades (sold-out dimming etc.)
- Cross-fades under MediaQuery.disableAnimations
Phase 4 — Gestures & latency
- Optimistic state: paint order-advance/table changes immediately, reconcile after server response (kill await _load()-before-paint in kitchen, staff, tables)
- Double-tap guards on kitchen/staff _advance (currently can skip a stage)
- Flick-to-advance on kitchen tickets + order cards: 1:1 drag → velocity projection → spring commit or rubber-band release (flagship interaction)
- Real detents (snapSizes) on DraggableScrollableSheets; snapping category strip; un-lock the wizard PageView drag
- Floor-plan drag: rubber-banding at canvas edges, snap-to-grid
- Unlock chat input during requests (type while waiting)
Phase 5 — A11y & haptics
- Restore text scaling in ShellAppBar (scope the web-glyph workaround), fix ~20 fixed-height-around-text containers (nav bar 68px, pill buttons, floor tiles)
- Semantics on QtyStepper, emoji tiles, cart badge, icon-only buttons
- Contrast fixes: sold-out 2.4:1, grey-on-cream body text, black26 disabled icons
- HapticFeedback at 7 commit moments: add-to-cart, payment success/failure, fire-to-kitchen, stage advance, stepper taps, validation errors
Phase 6 — Dark mode (blocker-sized)
- darkTheme + themeMode
- Migrate 129 Colors.white, 49 black, 58 grey, 165 status colors, 28 hex literals → scheme roles
- Replace Opacity(...) "disabled" hack with a real color role
Phase 7 — Spatial polish
- Hero flights: menu card → item sheet → cart → checkout (shared-element continuity)
- RootGate login→shell transition (currently a hard tree swap with zero transition)
- Unify menu-picker's instant list→detail swap with the sheet language used by the customer flow
- Haptic + directional consistency pass on route transitions
